      <purpose>To record the places visited by an individual that may inform a healthcare provider regarding the risk of infectious disease or other health-related exposure.</purpose>
      <use>Use to gradually build up a record of the places visited by an individual, that may inform a healthcare provider regarding the risk of infectious disease or other health-related exposure.&#xD;
&#xD;
This archetype has been designed to build a record related to a single 'home base'. If the individual moves to live in a significantly different location, the associated health risks may change and it may be useful to start another instance of this archetype.</use>
